{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:61316","published":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-09-02T10:45:04.173375915Z","related":["CVE-2026-15928"],"summary":"Important: xmlrpc-c security update","details":"XML-RPC is a remote procedure call (RPC) protocol that uses XML to encode its calls and HTTP as a transport mechanism. The xmlrpc-c packages provide a network protocol to allow a client program to make a simple RPC (remote procedure call) over the Internet. It converts an RPC into an XML document, sends it to a remote server using HTTP, and gets back the response in XML.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * xmlrpc-c: XMLRPC-C Library: Cross-Site Scripting in error page component (CVE-2026-15928)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"xmlrpc-c","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/xmlrpc-c"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.51.0-17.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:61316.json"}},{"package":{"name":"xmlrpc-c-c++","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/xmlrpc-c-c%2B%2B"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.51.0-17.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:61316.json"}},{"package":{"name":"xmlrpc-c-client","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/xmlrpc-c-client"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.51.0-17.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:61316.json"}},{"package":{"name":"xmlrpc-c-client++","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/xmlrpc-c-client%2B%2B"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.51.0-17.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:61316.json"}},{"package":{"name":"xmlrpc-c-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/xmlrpc-c-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.51.0-17.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:61316.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:61316"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-15928"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2507394"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/9/ALSA-2026-61316.html"}]}